request held v1 "Equipment request"
description "A hold made by the requester's department, whoever asks (fictional rules): the ones above every department have no department to name a budget by, and their request is refused when it is submitted"

use organization org from "../../examples/shared/company.ringi"
use calendar office from "../../examples/shared/office.cal"
use book budget from "../../examples/shared/budget.book"

form
  what   : text "What"  count >=1 <=100
  amount : money[JPY] "Amount"  range >=1JPY <=1_000_000JPY

route
  decide  manager

who
  manager = manager of requester
  board   = team board

every stage
  due in 3 business days at end of day
  when late escalate, then expire
  when empty escalate, then board

ticket
  self approval  not allowed
  withdraw       until decide
  on submitted   hold budget.reserve(request: ticket.id, attempt: ticket.attempt, dept: requester.department, amount: amount)
  on approved    post budget.reserve(request: ticket.id, attempt: ticket.attempt)
  on rejected, withdrawn, expired  void budget.reserve(request: ticket.id, attempt: ticket.attempt)

# the hold is made of the budget of the requester's department, and posted when the request is approved
scenario held_and_posted
  requester e1201
  given budget.allocate(dept: "sales1", period: "2026", amount: 500_000JPY)
  form what = "A monitor", amount = 60_000JPY
| at               | event   | by    | -> stage | status      |
| 2026-11-16 10:00 | submit  | e1201 | decide   | in progress |
| 2026-11-16 11:00 | approve | e1101 |          | approved    |

# a rejection gives the amount back to the department
scenario held_and_voided
  requester e1201
  given budget.allocate(dept: "sales1", period: "2026", amount: 500_000JPY)
  form what = "A monitor", amount = 60_000JPY
| at               | event  | by    | -> stage | status      |
| 2026-11-16 10:00 | submit | e1201 | decide   | in progress |
| 2026-11-16 11:00 | reject | e1101 |          | rejected    |
